        <mxCell id="ctx_item1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#00796b;&quot;&gt;✅ [1] Nhà nghiên cứu / Tác giả đề xuất (Active)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#455a64;&quot;&gt;• Đơn vị: &lt;b&gt;Viện Công nghệ Sinh học (VAST)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Quyền: &lt;i&gt;GRANT.PROPOSAL.WRITE, PROJECT.OWN.READ&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e0f2f1;strokeColor=#80cbc4;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="s2_ctx_dropdown"><mxGeometry x="12" y="60" width="415" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ctx_item2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#1565c0;&quot;&gt;🔄 [2] Chuyên gia Phản biện (Reviewer)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#455a64;&quot;&gt;• Đơn vị: &lt;b&gt;Hội đồng Độc lập Quỹ Truyền thống &amp;amp; Hữu nghị&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Phạm vi: &lt;i&gt;REVIEW.ASSIGNMENT (Chỉ 02 hồ sơ: #R100, #R104)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cfd8dc;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="s2_ctx_dropdown"><mxGeometry x="12" y="118" width="415" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ctx_item3" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#ef6c00;&quot;&gt;🔄 [3] Đại diện Tổ chức Đối tác (Partner Rep)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#455a64;&quot;&gt;• Đơn vị: &lt;b&gt;Phòng Quản lý Khoa học - VAST Liaison&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Quyền: &lt;i&gt;ORG.AFFILIATION.VERIFY, ORG.PROJECTS.VIEW&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cfd8dc;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="s2_ctx_dropdown"><mxGeometry x="12" y="175" width="415" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

